        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The table below shows the proportion of the workforce who are women and the proportion of managers who are women in five different countries. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CrEfd6gnEob8yMxZhmnlANcVgfL\"><em><strong>The table below shows the proportion of the workforce who are women and the proportion of managers who are women in five different countries. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Women in Workforce and Management</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZDcadQf71oVOdQxgNOrlUbPKg0f\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Women in Workforce and Management y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ phụ nữ tham gia lực lượng lao động v&agrave; tỷ lệ nữ l&agrave;m quản l&yacute; tại năm quốc gia kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9UcdMJh6onhxcxxeV5lxIE0gMb\">Paraphrase đề Women in Workforce and Management với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ phần trăm - phụ nữ tham gia lực lượng lao động - nữ quản l&yacute; - 5 quốc gia kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Overview</strong>&nbsp;</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nz9NdPKpboGw7uxWjyxlZk81gJg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nhật Bản dẫn đầu về <strong>tỷ lệ nữ lao động</strong>, trong khi &Uacute;c v&agrave; Mỹ dẫn đầu về <strong>tỷ lệ nữ l&agrave;m quản l&yacute;.</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W2VWd2KkJoVASWxT4cAlrYMAgYX\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sri Lanka v&agrave; Nhật Bản c&oacute; <strong>sự ch&ecirc;nh lệnh lớn nhất giữa tỷ lệ nữ lao động v&agrave; nữ l&agrave;m quản l&yacute;.</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IDj9dtyL0ooJgcxcQMElPH6JgGp\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n Body r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Body 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c nước ph&aacute;t triển (United States, Australia v&agrave; Japan</strong><strong>)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OetFdXVODorkkqxspn2lM5u9ghh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của United States</strong> <em>(46% workforce, cao hơn 3% so với management)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2TOdS20wohOlsxsFpOlCDoAgob\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Australia</strong> <em>(both ~43%).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ltb8dXLRFogaTtxlfL1lkT7SgMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Japan</strong> <em>(48% workforcem, <strong>gấp ba lần</strong> 17% management).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdE8dF5bToAP7Ixqd9tlDYpFgSb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JdE8dF5bToAP7Ixqd9tlDYpFgSb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Body 2:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c nước c&ograve;n lại (Sri Lanka v&agrave; Egypt</strong><strong>)</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ANcndR2Apo9zLFxsShDlLncWgKh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Sri Lanka</strong> <em>(42% workforce, 9% management <strong>thấp nhất</strong> trong 5 nước).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gqa5dv2eWopZpvxAaO5lqdPCgmb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của Egypt</strong> <em>(20% workforce, gần <strong>gấp đ&ocirc;i</strong> 12% management).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c bằng những c&aacute;ch sau đ&acirc;y khi n&oacute;i về \"phụ nữ l&agrave;m c&aacute;c vị tr&iacute; quản l&yacute;\" nh&eacute;:&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>women in management/managerial positions</strong>.</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>management/managerial roles</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>female managers</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 241,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MpSOdD6B3ooYyqxHE4RlKxk2gjd\">The table illustrates the percentage of women who participate in the workforce and those who are female managers across five different nations.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13663,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 242,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I4cbdEODUotuM4xyMVAlli4Vg5c\">Overall, while Japan has the highest rate of working women, Australia and the United States lead in the proportion of women in management positions. In addition, Sri Lanka and Japan maintain the largest gap between women's labour force participation and their representation in management roles.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13663,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 243,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QbBCdBwWLo2PMfx0FxElCzqtgSH\">Regarding the three developed countries, women in the United States account for 46% of the workforce, which is 3% higher than the figure for those in managerial positions, at 43%. Female Australians constitute similar proportions in both categories, standing at around 43%. In contrast, 48% of the workforce in Japan are women, nearly triple the rate of those in managerial roles, at only 17%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13663,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 244,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRA5d9xnRoBNRIxtZcJlGPjxgbH\">Turning to the remaining nations, although 42% of workers in Sri Lanka are female, they constitute only 9% of management positions in that country, which is the lowest of the five listed. Similarly, a relatively large disparity is also seen in Egypt, as 20% of their labour force is comprised of women, nearly double the percentage of female managers, at only 12%.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13663,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
